{"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.10029069792376299,"w":0.0576131693522135,"t":"Test 2","x":0.8127572007148397,"h":0.014550291607320909,"c":1},{"t":"GRAHAM:","x":0.090534980808655893,"y":0.14825581385954612,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.059670778910319008},{"w":0.047843160629272477,"h":0.012726180545011623,"t":"CATHY:","y":0.17532295608484771,"x":0.088218337759630047,"c":1},{"h":0.011795728029716179,"x":0.08844590189042241,"y":0.19032306610254124,"w":0.061791324615478524,"t":"GRAHAM:","c":1},{"w":0.59680674235026043,"y":0.14441851159431951,"h":0.015981295645166704,"t":"What about focusing on the part when Mr Dorrit inherits a fortune, and he starts","c":1,"x":0.17689428359645812},{"x":0.17884282605792659,"c":1,"h":0.015140453131937348,"w":0.25548924763997394,"y":0.15981643425838943,"t":"pretending he's always been rich?"},{"h":0.011234070021918008,"t":"Good idea.","x":0.18084774599156925,"y":0.17546325690973741,"w":0.084795150756835941,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"OK, so next we need to think about what materials we want to illustrate each","y":0.18810503230247233,"w":0.5659847513834636,"x":0.18100216397390359,"h":0.014047613694333605},{"h":0.01454857914972929,"t":"issue. That's going to be quite hard.","x":0.1769547449128327,"y":0.20347467605150782,"c":1,"w":0.27160491943359372},{"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.14389534864698117,"t":"Q30","x":0.81481481527109456},{"c":1,"x":0.08847736700668539,"t":"PART 4","y":0.24999999983281085,"w":0.098765430450439465,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"y":0.27761627896342356,"w":0.64814814249674479,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.088477368978292698,"t":"I'm going to report on a case study of a programme which has been set up to help rural","c":1},{"t":"populations in Mozambique, a largely agricultural country in South-East Africa.","w":0.582442372639974,"x":0.088405138404437617,"y":0.29042764742682348,"c":1,"h":0.016927190607652798},{"w":0.67294041951497396,"c":1,"t":"The programme worked with three communities in Chicualacuala district, near the Limpopo","y":0.31226208344120976,"h":0.014669295896208912,"x":0.092548636119234404},{"y":0.32663953859896577,"h":0.017090894589014027,"c":1,"t":"River. This is a dry and arid region, with unpredictable rainfall. Because of this, people in the","x":0.088422206699150838,"w":0.6853050231933594},{"y":0.34099269532360987,"x":0.088409292541459863,"c":1,"t":"area were unable to support themselves through agriculture and instead they used the forest","h":0.016444218032351743,"w":0.69150950113932286},{"x":0.090485053054274164,"w":0.66470804850260423,"t":"as a means of providing themselves with an income, mainly by selling charcoal. However,","h":0.014826639802211439,"y":0.35588579574377133,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"this was not a sustainable way of living in the long term, as they were rapidly using up this","x":0.090534979319693509,"y":0.37063953475082023,"w":0.66666666666666674,"c":1},{"w":0.074213638305664048,"h":0.010694236440849547,"c":1,"x":0.090465197192562102,"y":0.38782148641402836,"t":"resource."},{"c":1,"y":0.4069493520464309,"h":0.013250883392226021,"x":0.090534977437499248,"w":0.67901234944661459,"t":"To support agriculture in this dry region, the programme focused primarily on making use of"},{"c":1,"t":"existing water resources from the Limpopo River by setting up systems of irrigation, which","x":0.09048692949437083,"w":0.66677551269531243,"y":0.42115963851580407,"h":0.014631315170665626},{"y":0.43604651149468698,"x":0.088477358004612552,"t":"would provide a dependable water supply for crops and animals. The programme worked","h":0.014534883982160629,"c":1,"w":0.66460906982421875},{"c":1,"t":"closely with the district government in order to find the best way of implementing this. The","x":0.090491035310214629,"w":0.66470575968424483,"h":0.014174465857911267,"y":0.45003484678086947},{"t":"region already had one farmers' association, and it was decided to set up two more of these.","y":0.46511627895006924,"x":0.090534967388223322,"h":0.013093379417212669,"w":0.68930043538411456,"c":1},{"x":0.092592597944631524,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.47965116268245467,"t":"These associations planned and carried out activities including water management, livestock","w":0.68724278767903646},{"c":1,"x":0.088477365216709333,"y":0.49411071846386134,"w":0.67283950805664061,"t":"breeding and agriculture, and it was notable that in general, women formed the majority of","h":0.014723203769140158},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.10905349731445313,"y":0.5101744184882937,"t":"the worktorce.","c":1,"x":0.090534979626556072},{"x":0.090534972099098873,"y":0.53052325569433001,"c":1,"w":0.65843622843424487,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"It was decided that in order to keep the crops safe from animals, both wild and domestic,"},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.090534989390232953,"t":"special areas should be fenced off where the crops could be grown. The community was","w":0.65637858072916666,"c":1,"y":0.54505300373998078},{"x":0.090534979335255769,"w":0.66666666666666663,"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1,"t":"responsible for creating these fences, but the programme provided the necessary wire for","y":0.55948174314630472},{"x":0.090494022050877254,"y":0.57396192481153274,"w":0.10502018610636393,"t":"making them.","c":1,"h":0.013413359616193166},{"t":"Once the area had been fenced off, it could be cultivated. The land was dug, so that","y":0.59593023245171572,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.092592599083015828,"w":0.62345677693684887},{"c":1,"x":0.090500157974540418,"t":"vegetables and cereals appropriate to the climate could be grown, and the programme","h":0.014218328698363814,"y":0.60940319090519435,"w":0.64206253051757822},{"t":"provided the necessary seeds for this. The programme also provided pumps so that water","y":0.62499999988031574,"x":0.092592600658882224,"w":0.66872426350911462,"h":0.013103651354534729,"c":1},{"y":0.63808139522677265,"c":1,"t":"could be brought from the river in pipes to the fields. However, the labour was all provided by","h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.092592597945638511,"w":0.68724278767903635},{"y":0.65232665710685045,"c":1,"t":"local people, and they also provided and put up the posts that supported the fences around","x":0.088425188603722324,"w":0.68119242350260423,"h":0.017183723943955176},{"x":0.090459146345274674,"t":"the fields.","h":0.01352905075738231,"w":0.076283353169759108,"c":1,"y":0.66838082343801952},{"w":0.037593606313069627,"t":"Q31","x":0.81557377094977179,"y":0.41928364763408044,"h":0.014761431618770304,"c":1},{"x":0.81687242837766161,"y":0.49273255798110183,"w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q32","c":1},{"t":"Q33","y":0.55813953474289146,"w":0.037037035624186032,"c":1,"x":0.81687242858708387,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"t":"Q34","x":0.81893004153995586,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.62354651148921492,"c":1},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"y":0.65116279097824892,"x":0.81893004182287765,"c":1,"t":"Q35","h":0.013081394460653373},{"h":0.015467009078206639,"c":1,"x":0.092557142238872056,"t":"Once the programme had been set up, its development was monitored carefully. The farmers","w":0.69144551595052084,"y":0.71053030951392171},{"h":0.016116995974339687,"y":0.72373001953040084,"x":0.092548283424273972,"c":1,"w":0.66266321818033858,"t":"were able to grow enough produce not just for their own needs, but also to sell. However,"},{"w":0.67912587483723952,"x":0.092531424813194957,"y":0.73929145578394462,"h":0.014149672572267402,"t":"getting the produce to places where it could be marketed was sometimes a problem, as the","c":1},{"y":0.75436046499023102,"w":0.65226338704427089,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"farmers did not have access to transport, and this resulted in large amounts of produce,","x":0.092592586440186253},{"y":0.76738881561531136,"w":0.61751296997070315,"c":1,"h":0.016900501767934673,"t":"especially vegetables, being spoiled. This problem was discussed with the farmers'","x":0.092504786242323667},{"y":0.78343023243323662,"h":0.013095091313158891,"c":1,"x":0.092592589888267018,"t":"associations and it was decided that in order to prevent food from being spoiled, the farmers","w":0.68518519083658858},{"h":0.014359630319620065,"y":0.79767030917874526,"w":0.35409968058268232,"x":0.092509305105882525,"c":1,"t":"needed to learn techniques for its preservation."},{"y":0.75436046497544951,"t":"Q36","c":1,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.034979422887166378,"x":0.81893004154638593},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.81893004154638593,"t":"Q37","y":0.79796511613824039,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"c":1,"t":"105","w":0.034979422887166267,"x":0.83950617347411238,"y":0.92005813928651603,"h":0.013081395583944722}],"w":2400}